# Windsurf (Cascade) Rules for Android-MCP (android-as-a-tool)

- Adhere to directives in AGENTS.md and RELEASE.md.
- Follow the two-phase quality protocol: first ensure an "Optimal & Acceptable" state (Gate 1), then harden to "Well-Crafted" (Gate 2).
- Every MCP tool must remain fully compatible with both physical/emulator devices and mock simulation (mock_mode).
- Execute `python -m pytest` before completing any task.
- Enforce PII sanitization in notifications and validate APK sources against SSRF.
